  "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/steipete/gifgrep/tarball/v0.4.2",
  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/steipete/gifgrep/zipball/v0.4.2",
  "body": "**Highlights:** TUI selection, Escape, and download handling are fixed; API keys never leak into transport errors.\n\n- TUI: keep selection visible in small terminals, show the serving provider after fallback, and isolate saved/prefetched files by asset URL so reveal cannot open an unrelated download.\n- TUI: exit on closed input, handle standalone Escape, and cancel background downloads when replacing results or quitting.\n- Search: keep API keys and queries out of transport errors, and return failure when buffered stdout cannot be written.\n- Extraction: use the complete GIF, include every frame when requested, reject invalid timestamps, and validate image/sheet dimensions before allocation (40-million-pixel sheet limit).\n- Docs: correct search formats, thumbnail flags and protocol help, optional JSON fields, and terminal preview behavior; keep the generated site in sync.\n- Compatibility: source builds now require Go 1.26, the oldest maintained Go line, for the updated terminal/system dependencies; prebuilt binary usage is unchanged.\n- Dependencies: update x/term to 0.46.0, x/sys to 0.48.0, and Playwright to 1.63.0; test Linux/macOS, the minimum Go line, race detection, built CLI commands, and generated docs in CI.\n"
}
